{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56300","headline":"题伏波庙 · 司马□","name":"题伏波庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对令班南海，蛮兵避郁林。\n天涯分柱界，徼外贡输金。\n坐失奸臣意，谁明报主恩。\n一棺忠勇骨，漂泊瘴烟深。\n（见阮崱《安南志略》卷十六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马□","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}